# Startup preset for the TI-58C: the TI-58C with
# the Master Library module and the PC-100C. Set it as the TI-58C's startup
# preset ([preset] TI-58C in Calc-U-59.ini). Like every preset it cold boots
# the machine: the constant memory of ti58c.memory.yaml does not come back
# while it is set.

format-version: 2
model: TI-58C
preset-name: TI-58C
description: The TI-58C with the Master Library module and the PC-100C
slot-1: { name: ML }
printer: PC-100C
